deg2rad(input, *, out=None) -> Tensor

Returns a new tensor with each of the elements of :attr:`input`
converted from angles in degrees to radians.

Args:
    input (Tensor): the input tensor.

Keyword arguments:
    out (Tensor, optional): the output tensor.

